<title>USA: BOXING-WHITAKER RETAINS WBC WELTERWEIGHT TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-WHITAKER RETAINS WBC WELTERWEIGHT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Pernell Whitaker won a unanimous 12-round decision over Wilfredo Rivera of Puerto Rico to retain his World Boxing Council welterweight title on Friday.</p>
</text>
